  **                      Mulliken analysis                       **
  **                         ELSI Support                         **
  ******************************************************************

  ******************************************************************
  **               New/Experimental functionality:                **
  **         use_local_index and load balancing support           **
  **         Dielectric constant/absorption coefficents           **
  **             Specifying restricted energy window              **
  **                         Cube files                           **
